WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:35.580
Chop, Chop, you reek of dog...

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:36.200
<b>Just One Masterful Method</b>

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:38.130
You reek of dog...

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.610
Reek of dog, reek of—

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:41.450
Hey.

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:52.420
<i>What?!</i>

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:55.590
<i>What's she doing at my house? 
How'd she get my address?</i>

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.300
<i>Is this some kind of raid?</i>

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.470
What? Did you want something?

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:05.650
Wait, is this going to turn violent?! 
I have to head to school—

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.350
Don't grab my skirt like it's my collar!

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:09.170
Hey, you...

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:09.690
Yes?!

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.610
Are you smart?

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.260
Uh, my grades? They're average, I guess?

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.030
<i>They're below average, actually...</i>

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.950
I see.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.370
I'm having some trouble with my homework.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:25.330
Um...

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:28.050
Mayu-nii is useless when 
it comes to studying,

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:31.080
so you guys were the only ones 
I could think of to go to.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.500
<i>Stare...</i>

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:37.850
Oh, uh, please, allow me to help you.

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:38.840
All right.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.090
<i>What?!</i>

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.860
<i>What's with her attitude? 
What a cocky little shit!</i>

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:44.490
<i>But it's just grade school homework.</i>

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:47.600
<i>I'll show her how smart 
high school girls can be!</i>

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:53.020
Answer

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:53.190
Question 1: These 2 triangles are congruent.
Find the length of line A.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.000
<i>Oh, a diagram question.</i>

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:53.440
<i>What?</i>

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:56.370
<i>This is way harder than I was expecting...</i>

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:59.040
<i>Come to think of it, Chiharu-chan 
goes to Eihei Girls' Academy,</i>

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.860
<i>which is a pretty famous 
prep school for rich girls.</i>

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.190
<i>Shit. What should I do?</i>

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:04.780
Oh.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:06.420
That's the wrong one.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.200
Huh?

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.560
I can answer that one.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:09.370
Huh?!

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:12.750
By the way, Chiharu-chan, 
how'd you know my address?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:13.460
Miyamo

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.210
Oh, when I was borrowing Mayu-nii's PC,

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.210
I happened to see your 
address marked on the map.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.210
Miyamo's House

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:19.970
Oh, I see.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:20.740
<i>Wait...</i>

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.530
Found it. Here.

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:23.550
Okay...

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:27.080
Let's see, the subject is... social studies?

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:33.400
Using your current abilities, explain how you would earn 500 yen within 24 hours.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:33.400
<i>Using your current abilities, explain how 
you would earn 500 yen within 24 hours.</i>

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.800
<i>Whoa, this is hardcore.</i>

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.390
<i>Are they, like... trying to 
instill business sense</i>

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:40.710
<i>in these girls while they're still young?</i>

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:43.320
<i>Eihei Girls' Academy is amazing.</i>

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.920
<i>If I were Chiharu-chan...</i>

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:49.210
<i>Something I could do to make money...</i>

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.040
@saito
05 for just the bottom
08 for both top and bottom

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.590
I'll do it back there.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.330
School... girl...

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.820
That'll be 20K.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.340
<i>The worst... I am the absolute worst!</i>

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.680
Just curious... What did you think 
up for this, Chiharu-chan?

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.600
Yeah, about that... 
As soon as we got this assignment...

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.510
Mugging someone.

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:13.440
Mugging refers to the action in which one 
coerces another to give them money.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:17.360
I cannot allow that. 
Indisputable criminal acts are not allowed.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.980
However, new business ventures 
usually start from a gray area,

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.760
so keep that in mind.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.200
Yes, sir.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:24.950
Is what he said.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.280
<i>Is that school really okay?</i>

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:30.470
Five hundred yen? 
You mean without mugging someone?

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:36.130
Then you could go find a bike lying 
around somewhere and sell it for parts.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.130
<b>Yashimura</b>

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.490
Mayu-nii impressed me, as always,

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:41.460
but I don't know how to 
take apart any machines.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.860
You're currently in high school, aren't you?!

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.130
Now, tell me!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.490
<i>This is my chance...</i>

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:52.460
<i>to show this cocky little shit</i>

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.870
<i>my dignity as an older woman.</i>

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:57.360
Hey...

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.480
There's a way.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.400
Just one masterful way.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.280
<b>Flammable trash bag for home use</b>

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:05.280
What's that?

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.700
All the empty cans that my dad drank from.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.520
Someone I know once told me...

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.330
My job?

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:18.290
Collecting cans brings in a lot of cash, 
but you need to be smart about it.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.890
The factory not far from here 
apparently buys them.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.550
Huh...

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:27.760
I call it the "Get Rich Quick By 
Selling Recyclable Waste" plan!

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:32.120
Not only are you recycling, but it fits 
in with your assignment, doesn't it?

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.180
True...

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.100
You're pretty smart.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:39.820
Well, yeah. I have a lot 
more experience than you.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:42.110
<i>Yes! Just a little more...</i>

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.570
H-Hey, do we have to flatten all of these?

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.780
Of course!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.900
Always sell goods in their best condition!

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:52.580
That's common sense!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.990
It'll be flattened during the 
recycling process anyway,

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.800
so if we go ahead and do it for 
them, they'll appreciate it!

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.850
Plus, it takes up less space, 
so it'll be easier to carry around.

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:01.750
Howzat?!

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:03.880
T-True...

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.740
Right?!

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:09.760
They remove the water from orange juice 
to make it lighter for transport, too!

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.120
H-Hey...

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:15.680
There are hard cans and soft cans.
Do we need to separate them?

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.100
<i>Got her.</i>

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:20.900
I think we just need the hard ones.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.820
Harder material is always better, right?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.630
I mean, diamonds are the hardest.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.030
Right...

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.700
Okay, let's go.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.950
R-Right...

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.150
Go ahead and put it in here.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:40.970
Okay...

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.590
Yah!

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:05.820
What... is this?

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.730
What is it? It's how much you get 
for three kilograms of steel cans!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:10.570
<b>We buy aluminum cans
for a high price!!</b>

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.300
And did you have to bring 
such a half-assed amount?

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:13.010
Also, don't smash the cans!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.560
It messes with the machines 
when we press them!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.690
Sorry...

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:17.700
What?

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.980
Also, next time, just bring
aluminum cans instead!

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.030
They're worth ten times more!

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:23.000
God, what a waste of time!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:28.170
The aluminum cans are the softer cans, right?

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.790
Didn't you say...

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.010
I did not.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:34.290
What? But you said something about 
diamonds being hard, so the harder ones—

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.390
I said no such thing.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.680
And you said they'd be worth 
more if we flattened—

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.560
I did not!

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:45.620
Uh, you're not a kid, so stop yelling. 
This was your mistake, wasn't it?

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:46.550
Just admit it.

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:47.240
Was not.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:48.790
Uh, speak up.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:49.440
Then...

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.950
You should've just looked it up yourself! 
Don't put this all on me!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.630
Also, if we'd used the aluminum cans, 
you'd have passed the assignment, right?

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.830
So just write that you used aluminum ones!

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.710
It's not like I...

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.670
Hey, are you...

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:06.690
actually crying?

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:13.510
We worked so hard... 
and it was only worth 50 yen!

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:15.930
Seriously?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:20.950
H-Hey, stop crying. You can use that 
money to buy some chocolate, okay?

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:26.680
<i>Well, if anything, I now know for 
sure that she's not Mayu-nii's girl.</i>

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:28.230
<i>She's way too pathetic.</i>

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.570
<i>At least I found that out.</i>

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.390
Come on, stop crying. We're in public.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:36.320
Yeah... What's this line for, anyway?

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:37.590
Ah.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.270
Huh? Manana!

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:41.130
Chio-chan... and Andou's sister?!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:42.410
What are you doing?

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:46.020
Apparently the shop up ahead 
is having a crazy sale.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.840
Sale!!

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.840
Huh?! But we have to go to school!

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:50.170
Not to worry! I'm taking the day off.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.260
You can't! Come on, we're going to school.

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.260
Hey, stop it!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.840
Who am I supposed to hang out with 
at lunch if you're not there?!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.990
Shut up! Just faceplant 
on your desk and sleep!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.680
Besides, that shop's super expensive,

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:02.370
so with your allowance, 
you could only buy, like, a coaster!

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.180
Huh? What?

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:05.050
It'd be a waste of time to stand in line

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:07.730
for hours just to buy something 
for a few hundred yen!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.020
Y-You really think s—

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.610
Come on, let's go! 
Otherwise I'm telling the school on you!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.990
Uh... W-Wait a sec... Th-Th...

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.360
Then I'll sell it!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:19.240
I'll sell the right to stand here to someone!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:22.620
I don't want all the time I spent 
in line to go to waste! No! No!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.620
M-Manana!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.050
W-Wait!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.800
I'll take that spot! Okay?

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.000
Hey, I'll buy it for 1,000 yen!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.040
Then I'll pay 1,500 yen!

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.970
Then I'll pay 2,000 yen!

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.930
Then I'll pay 2,500 yen!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:42.140
Did that actually work out? 
I mean, it's not a bad thing...

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.610
A line agent...

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:44.810
It costs me nothing.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.470
And if it only requires standing, 
even I could do it.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.480
It's perfect...

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:50.530
Hm?

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.340
It's perfect!

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:53.570
Huh? What is?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.290
You're amazing!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:56.950
Huh? I-I am?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.950
<i>She beat the crap out of Mayu-nii before, too.</i>

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.580
<i>She might actually be amazing!</i>

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:07.680
Hey, Chio-chan... I don't know what's 
going on with Andou's sister.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:08.960
I mean, to begin with...

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:10.350
Chio-chan?

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:11.300
Manana.

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:17.420
I think it's pretty obvious that 
I get a cut of that money, right?

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:18.440
Huh?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.340
Wh-Why?

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:24.010
If I hadn't passed by, that situation 
would never have happened.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:26.380
You would've never received that money.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:27.520
Huh? What?!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.390
I'll settle for half.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:32.040
<i>J-Just from being with her 
for only a few minutes...</i>

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.040
Really, half is fine, okay?!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.190
N-No way!

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.280
Then a third will be fine!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.440
Wh-What are you—

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.620
Just a third will be fine!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.140
Come on, Manana!

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:42.120
<i>She's older than me, but she's such a failure.</i>

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.250
<i>She acts like a know-it-all 
toward anyone younger,</i>

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:46.180
<i>she'll shift the blame 
if she makes a mistake,</i>

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:48.040
<i>and she's underhanded with money.</i>

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.730
<i>Man... I was so stupid.</i>

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:55.880
<i>I can't believe I mistook her for 
the girl that Mayu-nii liked...</i>

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.880
<b>Chio's</b>

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:58.880
School Road

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.880
<i>Chio's School Road</i>!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.240
It sure is hard to make money.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.550
Sure is.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:06.470
Why don't you try becoming a pro
at streaming game playthroughs?

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.880
That won't work.

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:11.050
If it's not a game that's officially 
recognized, you can't monetize it,

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:12.940
and the competition's brutal.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.150
Wait, have you already tried it?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.120
Nope.

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:17.750
Can I search for you?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:18.940
Please don't.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:22.970
I got curious about the word 
"streak" in "kill streak"...

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:26.260
Sorry, but I don't even know 
what "kill streak" means.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.950
And then I ended up on the word "streaking."

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:32.040
Apparently it's some societal protest thing

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.170
you do by running around 
the city completely naked,

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:37.510
and it was really popular 
to do in the seventies.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:39.840
<b>Yuki-chan Bares It All</b>

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:40.590
What? They got naked just 
to express their opinions?

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:43.010
Man, people in the seventies were stupid!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.430
But... you know...

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:48.320
that must feel fantastic!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.310
Uh... Yuki-chan?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.230
Wait, you have a desire to run around naked?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:57.530
Huh? Well, when I get into my groove 
and gain enough speed while running,

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:01.280
I feel like if I take my clothes off, 
I might actually become the wind.

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:03.310
O-Oh...

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.890
You don't walk around your 
room naked, do you, Yuki-chan?

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.540
Wait, did I mention that before?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.790
<i>I was right!</i>

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:15.850
No... You hadn't told us before.

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:18.960
Huh? D-Did I say something 
I shouldn't have again?

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:22.540
But I at least wear an apron when I'm eating!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.890
Wait, what new sort of 
apron-only trend is that?

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.870
<i>Wait... Based on that explanation,</i>

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:31.310
<i>it's not just her room. She walks 
around her entire house naked.</i>

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:35.480
<i>I knew it. There's more to 
Yuki-chan than meets the eye.</i>

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.700
Do the other kids in our class know that?

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:43.570
No... I don't think my 
friends from class know yet.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:47.140
I'm pretty sure there are a 
lot of others like me, though.

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:49.150
Yeah, this girl's trouble.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:51.570
My parents are like that, too.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.210
Her whole family's trouble!

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:57.250
What are you guys doing? Let me join in!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.280
We're playing Ghost Blitz!

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:02.450
<i>Even though Yuki-chan's the queen bee,</i>

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:05.870
<i>she'd always cheerfully interact 
with below average girls like us.</i>

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.070
<i>She's really, really important...</i>

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.920
<i>To keep me from being harassed 
by any of the normie groups,</i>

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.390
<i>she's a really important...</i>

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:12.910
<i>deter—</i>

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.180
<i>friend!</i>

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.300
<i>I have to tell her as a friend</i>

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:19.730
<i>that she shouldn't tell others 
about that since it's not normal!</i>

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.510
<i>She might hate me for it...</i>

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.150
<i>But she's my friend!</i>

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:25.780
Manana?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.070
Yuki-san...

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:30.020
Isn't being naked awesome?

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:32.450
I walk around my house naked, too!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:36.170
Argh! This bitch went 
all-in on the flattery!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:41.090
<i>I'm naked when I take a bath, 
so I'm not exactly lying.</i>

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:47.630
Manana-chan...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.810
Is that true?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.720
Huh?!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:57.140
You're not teasing me... are you?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:00.650
My dad told me that being 
naked is a natural thing,

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.570
and it's okay to be proud of it.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.840
It's fine if people don't understand,

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.990
but it's also okay to get angry if 
people tease me for it, he said.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:09.710
So...

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:13.760
I can believe you, right?

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:17.460
You go about your everyday life 
in your house naked, right?

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:23.830
<i>You piece of shit!</i>

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.030
U-Um...

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:27.770
O-Of course it's true! I mean, I, uh...

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:28.930
Even now...

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.080
I-I-I-I-If I could...

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:35.020
I wish I could go to school 
without any panties on.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:39.560
<i>What? She panicked and made the 
worst possible move, that fool.</i>

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:42.980
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.140
Me, too!

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:44.860
Huh?

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:45.740
Huh?!

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:46.690
Huh?

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.290
Wait... Yuki-san?!

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:48.610
It's fine! It's fine!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:53.700
2 Minutes Later

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:53.700
<i>The material of the skirt is 
touching... It feels so weird.</i>

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.580
Thanks for waiting!

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.500
Manana, did you really—

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.710
<i>Seriously?! I mean that 
in so many ways right now!</i>

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.710
Let's go that way!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.260
Yup!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:11.760
Eek!

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:14.950
Manana-chan, Manana-chan!

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:17.110
You're fine! Great voice! Nice job!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:20.440
At what?! This is way more 
embarrassing than I thought it'd be!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:23.230
Don't just stand there! Be bold and free!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.990
Oh, hey, a cockroach.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.000
Wait, where?!

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.670
No, over here.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.360
G-Gross! Where is it?!

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:30.860
Looking good!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.200
Wait, what? No way!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.160
Damn you, Yuki-chan!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.160
Take this! Wind attack!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.870
Manana-chan! The wind tickles!

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.620
Jeez!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.690
I think I'm getting used to this.

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:47.460
Right?

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.220
Maybe it's not so bad after all.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:54.890
It's making me walk with my legs together, 
so don't I look more girly?

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.810
I feel so free, I might just 
start running at any moment!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.540
Come on, Yuki-chan! 
You can't do that. It'll be visible!

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.440
Besides, you always want to run.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.150
