one of your kind touching me.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.420
What's the matter?

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.060
Oh, nothing at all!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.970
<i>Huh? What the hell was that?</i>

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:30.190
<i>Like when that one tropical island tribe 
bungee jumps to prove their adulthood,</i>

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:32.760
<i>and laughs at the ones who 
couldn't go through with it?!</i>

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.920
Wait. That'd make me super boring!

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.800
No! I need a different analogy!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:37.870
<i>Yes...</i>

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:39.560
Chi-oh

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:41.370
<i>It's like two slaves that 
start bragging about</i>

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.760
<i>how beautiful the chains on their legs are!</i>

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:46.580
Isn't my chain gorgeous?

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.270
Mine's new!

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:51.030
<i>Before you know it, they're laughing 
at the one not wearing any chains!</i>

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.710
She doesn't have a chain on.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:53.430
Lame.

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:54.240
Gulp!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.450
Damn it! Who do you think 
you are, you damn slaves?!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:05.120
<i>But I don't think I've seen Manana 
laugh like that in a long time.</i>

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.130
<i>She's laughing way more 
than when she's with me...</i>

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:11.390
<i>Why? All you did was go commando!</i>

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:13.300
<i>How does one piece of cloth 
make such a difference?</i>

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:17.580
<i>No... Panties are the 
very symbol of intellect!</i>

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.430
<i>The seal that keeps instincts at bay.</i>

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.040
<i>In other words...</i>

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:24.180
<i>panties are a binding spell!</i>

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.860
Welcome.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:31.230
Um... I'd like to use the bathroom.

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:35.570
Manana, Yuki-chan! Wait!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.410
Chio-chan?!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.380
<i>Just you wait!</i>

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:45.250
<i>This is my...</i>

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.590
<i>resolve!</i>

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.510
Holy shit! This is super exciting!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.380
Chio-chan!

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:02.350
<i>I never knew I could be 
so honest with myself!</i>

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.230
<i>Going commando...</i>

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.990
<i>is the best!</i>

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.440
