seem extra radiant today.

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:19.130
I wonder why...

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:22.230
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:24.010
<i>I didn't expect to run 
into Kushitori-senpai...</i>

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:27.330
<i>If she finds out we've all gone 
commando, we're finished!</i>

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.190
<i>Our you-know-whats will be done for!</i>

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.760
Well, we're first-years in high school

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:34.580
and smack dab in the middle of our youth!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:36.760
Of course we're radiant!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:40.570
True... You three are always very radiant.

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:41.510
Yes!

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.310
